{"id":"1cca10a9c672fa5d","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-existence-theorem.md","title":"Existence Theorem","display":"df-existence-theorem — Existence Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-existence-theorem","aliases":["58-df-existence-theorem","Existence Theorem"],"display":"df-existence-theorem — Existence Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-existence-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-existence-theorem</span><span>Existence Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-existence-theorem — Existence Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s,x,\\phi,a\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s,x,\\phi,a\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[x\\mapsto a]\\in V\">\\(s[x\\mapsto a]\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExistentialWitness}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{ExistentialWitness}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}existence-theorem} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExistentialWitness}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s,x,\\phi,a)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\n\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\phi,s[x\\mapsto a])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}existence-theorem} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExistentialWitness}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s,x,\\phi,a)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\n\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\phi,s[x\\mapsto a])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}existence\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}semantic} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\n\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\n\\to\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\exists x\\,\\phi,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\mathrm{ExistentialWitness}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s,x,\\phi,a)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}existence\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}semantic} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\n\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\n\\to\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\exists x\\,\\phi,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\mathrm{ExistentialWitness}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s,x,\\phi,a)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The language, structure, assignment, and selected satisfaction recursion are explicit parameters; the semantic existential clause no longer relies on a hidden satisfaction relation.</li>\n<li>Examples: Cauchy integral formula (holomorphic existence), Arzelà-Ascoli (compactness)</li>\n<li>Constructive: constructive existence vs classical existence; Markov's principle</li>\n<li>Uniqueness often accompanies existence: unique maximizer under convexity conditions</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../bat